@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 17. Technology Options Comparison

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

rectangle "Option A\nSpring AI + LangGraph4J\n(Recommended)" as A
rectangle "Option B\nSpring AI only\n(custom orchestration)" as B
rectangle "Option C\nLangChain + LangGraph4J\n(future extension)" as C

note bottom of A
- fits current source best
- aligns with current build.gradle dependencies
- supports StateGraph, handoff, checkpoint, Redis persistence
end note

note bottom of B
- possible for simple flow
- graph complexity grows in code
- handoff/state resume less structured
end note

note bottom of C
- possible extension path
- not current standard
- adds extra framework surface
end note

A --> B : lower risk
A --> C : easier migration path

@enduml
